#!/usr/bin/env node
/*
 * grid14 step-by-step traffic simulator  (Node.js, standard library only)
 *
 * Implements the GRID-14 packet model (grid14_v1.pdf, Sections 1-7, Figures 1-4).
 * All numeric constants were read from the figures; see spec_values.md.
 *
 * Language/runtime: JavaScript on Node.js (see `node --version`). No external
 * modules are required; only the Node core modules 'fs', 'os', 'child_process'
 * (the last two only for the parallel sweep driver) are used.
 *
 * Modes (see dispatch at bottom):
 *   node simulator.js baseline
 *   node simulator.js config <cycle> <plan> <lead|lag> <o0..o8>   (offsets in seconds)
 *   node simulator.js trace  <outfile>                            (baseline AM trace)
 *   node simulator.js sweepchunk <prog> <offStart> <offEnd> <baseTTS>  (prints JSON)
