 * Env knobs (defaults = full exact sweep):
 *   NW=16           number of worker processes
 *   CHUNK=8192      offset combos per task (262144 per program)
 *   PLO=0 PHI=72    program index range [PLO,PHI)  (prog = cycleIdx*12 + (plan-1)*2 + order)
 *   OFFLO=0 OFFHI=262144   offset-combo range (for validation runs)
 *   BASE=4052648    baseline total TTS threshold for "below baseline"
 *   OUT=sweep_results.json   PROG=sweep_progress.json
